1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,580
W: I know that you've worked very hard the last couple of weeks preparing for the presentation, and I am sure that you will do an excellent job today.

2
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,595
I just wanted to wish you good luck.

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,440
M: Thanks.

4
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:14,820
I am a bit nervous right now, but at the same time I am quite confident.

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:19,295
I have worked very hard, and I really know my material inside out.

6
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,540
So, don't worry.

7
00:00:20,675 --> 00:00:21,540
I will do my best.

8
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,105
W: Actually, I feel very relieved to hear that from you.

9
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,625
I was a bit worried that you might not be ready.

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,420
Anyway, where is Mark?

11
00:00:30,085 --> 00:00:34,700
The traffic is quite bad at this time of the day, and I don't want to take any chances of being late.

12
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,400
M: Don't worry, Ms. Wang.

13
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,180
It usually only takes about fifteen minutes to get there from here.

14
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:44,560
If worst comes to worst, I can always get off and run there.
